    },
    {
        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Selena",
            "A correction, then. There isn't just an eye in the universe—there are also gazes. Perhaps one day in the future, ours will meet the gaze of another star.",
